{"find": "[[page ?]]\n\n125\n\nCHAPTER VIII. ST. VALENTINE’S DAY.\n\nNow what could artless Jeanie do? She had na will to say him na’: At length she blush’d a sweet consent, And love was ay between them twa. Burns.", "replace": "[[page 123]]\n\n# Chapter VIII.\n\n[[subtitle]] St. Valentine’s Day.\n\n<verse>\nNow what could artless Jeanie do?\nShe had na will to say him na’:\nAt length she blush’d a sweet consent,\nAnd love was ay between them twa.\n</verse>\n[[right]] <i>Burns.</i>"}
